[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2863627683","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106163#issuecomment-2863627683","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106163","id":2863627683,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6qr32j","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-08T16:24:27Z","updated_at":"2025-05-08T16:24:27Z","body":"> when render_mode cull_front is not used, every fragment can be seen on screen should get its FRONT_FACING value to be true,\n\nThis isn't correct if backface culling is disabled, then `FRONT_FACING` should return true for front faces and false for back faces despite them both being visible. \n\nAlso, for clarity, Godot doesn't calculate the value of `FRONT_FACING` we just use the value returned by [`gl_FrontFacing`](https://registry.khronos.org/OpenGL-Refpages/gl4/html/gl_FrontFacing.xhtml)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2863627683/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0